    "description": "I didn't address the lack of amenities in government hospitals as it has been addressed by many people in the past and as a little less knowledgeable guy, I feel the development does not match the ratio of intake of the patients in a day for sure. Thanks to our no control population. Don't worry, as I was popped out, I'll blame my dad too for not stopping with just one kid. ⁣\n⁣\nBut I'm addressing the most common humane issue, since it's something we all can do to realise that doctors aren't Gods. But they try their best to save us with whatever they have, atleast some of them do. To all the doctors and medicos, I hope things get better and you have everyone in this page to support you for whatever happened.⁣\n⁣\nFM.",
